    {
      "id": "fd2-would-like",
      "title": "I'd like…",
      "kind": "LEARN",
      "introduces": ["moechten", "trinken", "glas", "tasse"],
      "exercises": [
        {
          "id": "fd2-e1",
          "type": "TEACH",
          "title": "Ich möchte …",
          "body": "**möchten** = would like. It's the politest way to order:\n\n- ich möchte\n- du möchtest\n- er / sie möchte (no *-t*!)\n- wir / sie / Sie möchten",
          "mouthShapes": [
            { "shape": "ROUNDED", "label": "ö", "caption": "möchte: say e, then round your lips" }
          ],
          "examples": [
            { "text": "Ich möchte einen Kaffee.", "translation": "I'd like a coffee." },
            { "text": "Was möchtest du?", "translation": "What would you like?" },
            { "text": "Sie möchte ein Wasser.", "translation": "She'd like a water." }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "fd2-e2",
          "type": "TEACH",
          "title": "einen: the object form",
          "body": "Look closely:\n\n- *Das ist **ein** Kaffee.* This is a coffee.\n- *Ich möchte **einen** Kaffee.* I'd like a coffee.\n\nWhen a *der* word is the **object** (the thing you want, have, eat or drink), **ein** becomes **einen**. This object form is called the **accusative**.\n\nOnly *der* words change. *die* and *das* words stay the same: *Ich möchte **eine** Milch. Ich möchte **ein** Wasser.*",
          "examples": [
            { "text": "Ich möchte einen Tee.", "translation": "I'd like a tea.", "hint": "der Tee → einen" },
            { "text": "Ich möchte eine Milch.", "translation": "I'd like a milk.", "hint": "die Milch → eine" },
            { "text": "Ich möchte ein Bier.", "translation": "I'd like a beer.", "hint": "das Bier → ein" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "fd2-e3",
          "type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE",
          "instruction": "Which form fits? Ich möchte ___ Tee.",
          "prompt": "I'd like a tea.",
          "promptLanguage": "BASE",
          "options": ["ein", "einen", "eine"],
          "optionsLanguage": "TARGET",
          "answerIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "fd2-e4",
          "type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE",
          "instruction": "Which form fits? Ich möchte ___ Wasser.",
          "prompt": "I'd like a water.",
          "promptLanguage": "BASE",
          "options": ["ein", "einen", "eine"],
          "optionsLanguage": "TARGET",
          "answerIndex": 0
        },
